        "original_id": "a4a1a1ad-d5a9-572f-bd81-7add00cc7730",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry M. Morris, John C. Whitcomb, Ronald Numbers\n- Books: The Genesis Flood\n- Organizations: Creation Research Society, Institute for Creation Research\n- Concepts: young Earth creationism, Christian apologetics\n\nFacts:\n- Henry Madison Morris was born on October 6, 1918, and he was an American young Earth creationist, Christian apologist, and engineer.\n- In 1961, John C. Whitcomb and Henry M. Morris published The Genesis Flood: The Biblical Record and its Scientific Implications.\n- Ronald Numbers wrote that The Genesis Flood elevated young Earth creationism to a position of fundamentalist orthodoxy.\n- Henry M. Morris was one of the founders of the Creation Research Society and the Institute for Creation Research.\n- Henry Madison Morris died on February 25, 2006.",
